#
# Milestone M7 of the Racket reference engine: 4 conformance case(s).
#
# Emphasis dots and the ornamented complex.
#
# One case identifier per line, in the order `jlreq-conformance list` prints
# them. A `#` line and a blank line are comments. The nine files partition the
# eighty-nine built-in cases: every case is in exactly one of them, so the
# cumulative suite M1..Mn grows monotonically and M1..M9 is the whole suite.
#
# M7 is complete when the cumulative suite through M7 runs green:
#
#   cat engines/racket/milestones/M{1..7}.ids | ...select from suite.ndjson...
#   cargo run -p jlreq-conformance -- run ENGINE PARTIAL.ndjson   # exit 0

3.3.9/emphasis-horizontal-mixed-size
3.3.9/emphasis-vertical-mixed-size
B.2-note-9/ornamented-complex-run-aware-expansion
C.2-note-6/ornamented-runs-govern-breaks
